    "summary": "The Derelict Mine is a Cave found in the Maltic Plains.",
    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 6\n• Difficulty: Easy\n• Length: Short\n• Estimated time: 40s\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• The entrance to the cave has a large sign that reads \"DO NOT ENTER\", along with a smaller sign with red text that also reads DO NOT ENTER.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 1x Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nEnemies\n• Decaying Zombie (Lv. 3)\n• Zombie Archers (Lv. 3)\n• Putrid Zombies (Lv. 5)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +75 XP\n• +64 Emeralds",
