    "summary": "The Fungas Log is a Cave found in the Nivla Woods.",
    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 5\n• Difficulty: Easy\n• Length: Short\n• Estimated time: 40 seconds\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• This cave is a tunnel through a decaying tree stump that is filled with Fungal Parasites (Brown) and Fungal Parasites (Red). A Tier 1 [✫✫✫✫] Loot Chest can be found just before the ending room of the tunnel, and Tier 2 [✫✫✫✫] and Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫] Loot Chests can be found in the final room before the exit.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 1x Tier 1 [✫✫✫✫]\n• 1x Tier 2 [✫✫✫✫]\n• 1x Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +70 XP\n• +1 Unidentified Leaf Boots",
