    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 20\n• Difficulty: Medium\n• Length: Medium\n• Estimated time: 50s\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• The entrance to the cave leads to a crypt where several Skeleton Brides and Zombie Fiances are found. Continuing down the tunnel leads to a small room with a parkour over some vines.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 1x Tier 4 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nEnemies\n• Skeleton Brides (Lv. 21)\n• Zombie Fiances (Lv. 21)\n• Carnivorous Vines (Lv. 22)\n• Concealed Earth Creatures (Lv. 23)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +444 XP",
