    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 7\n• Difficulty: Easy\n• Length: Short\n• Estimated time: 40s\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• The entrance features a small pond encircled by a path. Several Spider-Infested Roots can be found along the path.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 1x Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nEnemies\n• Spider-Infested Roots (Lv. 6)\n• Forest Spiders (Lv. 5)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +150 XP\n• +1 Unidentified Leaf Pants",
