    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 26\n• Difficulty: Easy\n• Length: Medium\n• Estimated time: 1m 10s\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• The entrance of this cave leads to a room with a Tier 1 [✫✫✫✫] Loot Chest that is guarded by a single Loch Jaw. There is a path to continue on the left; however, there is also a shortcut directly to the bottom of the cave found on the right.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 3x Tier 1 [✫✫✫✫]\n• 1x Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nEnemies\n• Cave Carnivores (Lv. 23)\n• Loch Jaws (Lv. 25)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +600 XP",
