    "explanation": "Overview\n• Suggested level: 16\n• Difficulty: Easy\n• Length: Medium\n• Estimated time: 1m\n• Type: Normal\n\nRoute\n• This cave is a long tunnel though a crypt. There is a Tier 2 [✫✫✫✫] Loot Chest in the roots of the decaying tree found over the entrance. Crypt Parasites and Risen Skeletons can be found throughout the cave.\n\nLoot Chests\n• 2x Tier 2 [✫✫✫✫]\n• 1x Tier 3 [✫✫✫✫]\n\nEnemies\n• Crypt Parasites (Lv. 17)\n• Risen Skeletons (Lv. 18)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\n• +1,050 XP",
